      <div class="area-body">
      <h2>A move for your parent, without you taking on everything</h2>
      <p>When a parent needs to move, whether to a smaller home, closer to family, into a retirement village or somewhere with more support, the job often falls to adult children who are already busy and may live hours away. Chayce Properties coordinates the practical side so your parent stays at the centre and you are not left juggling removals, packing, estate agents and solicitors.</p>
      <p>Your parent and family get a single point of contact who plans the move with you, keeps everyone updated and handles the day itself. We can help sort and pack their belongings, stage the current home for sale, liaise with estate agents and solicitors, arrange a fully insured removal, and unpack and set up the new home so it feels familiar from the first evening.</p>
      <p>We start with a Discovery Consultation, from &pound;150, by phone or in person, which can include you and your parent together. It produces a written plan, timeline and budget, so the whole family knows what will happen and when.</p>
      <div class="area-honest">
        <p>We work with your parent, not around them. Their wishes come first, and we keep family members informed as much as they would like.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

